// Fisko-KlangFinance, round P39 (20 Nov 2569): the menu "เตรียมคำของบประมาณ" goes on (the readers and the finders of the first part are in 98zzzr).
// Asked for by the user after P38:
//   1 a division can send a case itself, and Planning receives it and checks it: new states "being prepared by the division" and
//     "sent, waiting for Planning"; Planning's button "receive" makes it a case of Planning;
//   2 the laws become a REGISTER with the conditions that check the documents: a register of laws (name, kind, year, clause, link,
//     checked or not) and a register of conditions (what is checked, for which kind of request, which of the five ready-made kinds of
//     check and its settings, which laws it comes from, whether a failure is a fail or only for a person to review); Planning adds, edits,
//     retires and deletes in both; the AI tab uses the register;
//   3 the attached files go to the condition they fit, and the page shows that data is already there: every condition shows the files it
//     used, and a file can be attached straight to a condition (it then counts as the document of that condition);
//   4 the sample buttons were not seen: they are now on the overview as well, on the form for a new case, and on the receiving tab, for
//     Planning and for a division, and a role that can't use them is told why.
// Still true: the laws are NOT checked against the text (the web search tools did not work when this was made). The register starts with the
// names of the laws and conditions written from the general principles, every law "not checked", no section number, no link, no limit
// claimed; Planning opens the text, writes the clause and the link and ticks "checked" (which needs both). The settings that are mine
// (tolerance 5%, 3 quotations, 1,000 million baht for the feasibility report) are now settings of the conditions, not words of the law.
// The AI is fixed rules, the picture reader is a simulation (see 98zzzr).

